      "trackName": "Numeroz",
      "description": "Numeroz is a fast-paced number game designed for Apple Watch and iPhone.\n\nTap the numbers in the correct order as quickly as possible. Each successful tap increases the challenge: balls move faster, the time limit becomes shorter, and distractions appear on the screen. One mistake or a timeout ends the game.\n\nThe game is built for short but intense sessions, on Apple Watch.\n\nFeatures:\n• Simple and intuitive gameplay\n• Increasing difficulty based on your performance\n• Time-based challenge that rewards speed and focus\n• Global leaderboard via Game Center\n\nTrain your reaction, concentration, and speed — and try to reach the top of the leaderboard.",
